{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>還在為晚餐去哪裡而傷腦筋？DinePilot 是一款餐廳決策工具，專為情侶、室友與朋友群組而設，把「吃什麼都可以」的無限循環化為數分鐘內可敲定的答案。原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂規則收窄選擇</h2>\n<p>在 My Spots 建立口袋名單，可手動加入或搜尋附近餐廳，再設定禁止快餐、預算上限、距離範圍或自訂規則。Venn Diagram 會即時顯示每項規則如何收窄選擇。準備好後，Tonight's Pick 在符合條件的名單中輪流抽出並鎖定結果，快速又公平。要與伴侶或朋友共同決定，可用分享碼同步名單與規則；所有資料只留在裝置並經 iCloud 私人同步，無帳戶、無追蹤、無廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-252-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-253-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-254-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-255-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-256-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-257-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：DinePilot</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:06:39.432924+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}